---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import AffiliateLink from "../../components/AffiliateLink.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Monster Hunter Wilds — Cross-Platform Buying Guide"
  description="Monster Hunter Wilds buying guide: Capcom's 2025 hunting epic, editions, and where to buy the digital version cheapest."
>
  <article class="post">
    <h1>Monster Hunter Wilds — Cross-Platform Buying Guide</h1>
    <p class="meta">Xbox / PS5 / PC · Updated 2026-08-05</p>

    <p>
      <strong>Monster Hunter Wilds</strong> is Capcom's 2025 entry in the long-running
      hunting series, with a seamless open environment, a new wound-based combat system,
      and the series' deepest story yet.
    </p>

    <h2>Standard vs Premium Deluxe</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Standard</strong> — the full game</li>
      <li><strong>Premium Deluxe</strong> — adds cosmetic gestures, a pet Palico, and a art book app; no gameplay advantage</li>
      <li><strong>Cross-play</strong> — full cross-play and cross-save across all platforms</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Where to buy cheapest</h2>
    <p>
      As a 2025 release, Wilds holds list price at first, with the first real cuts ahead
      of seasonal events. Green Man Gaming keys undercut the console stores when sales
      open — worth waiting for if you're not in a rush.
    </p>

    <ul class="buy-list">
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="gmg"
          href="https://www.greenmangaming.com/search/?q=monster+hunter+wilds"
          cta="Check Green Man Gaming"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <AffiliateLink
          network="amazon"
          href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Monster+Hunter+Wilds"
          cta="Check on Amazon"
        />
      </li>
    </ul>

    <p class="note">
      Prices change frequently — always verify on the store before purchasing.
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .post { padding: 1.5rem 0; max-width: 720px; }
  .post h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .buy-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
